{
  "_notes": [
    "Locally added -- upstream pinmame-nvram-maps has no X-Men map as of index rev 1406.",
    "Derived from a real xmn_151h.nv: records are 0x20 apart, NUL-terminated initials at +0x00 and a",
    "4-byte little-endian score at +0x18, the same record shape the other Stern SAM maps use.",
    "The five entries decode to Stern's factory default ladder (75M/55M/40M/30M/25M) with the stock",
    "'G S'/'L R'/'J R'/'D T'/'P P' initials, which is what confirms the addresses.",
    "Only xmn_151h is claimed: the other X-Men revisions were not checked and SAM high score",
    "addresses move between ROM revisions.",
    "A sixth record at 0x021030A0 ('YAN', 15) looks like a mode champion, but its meaning was not",
    "identified, so it is left out."
  ],
